    "text": "If the coefficients of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>18</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in powers of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;are both zero, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
