  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>18</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>=</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ax</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>bx</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mspace/><mn>18</mn></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mspace/><mn>18</mn></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.....</mo><msup><mspace/><mn>18</mn></msup><msub><mo>C</mo><mn>18</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><msup><mspace/><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><msup><mspace/><mn>18</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><msup><mspace/><mn>18</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><msup><mspace/><mn>18</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><msup><mspace/><mn>18</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>102</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1088</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>64</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>480</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Solution of the above two equation gives.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>b</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mn>7</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math></p>",
